(label "GND" (at 782.3199999999999 419.1 0) (effects (font (size .8 .8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9ccef349-37ec-4d1d-b383-0e161828cf19))(text "USB-C: Adafruit4056 panel extension to Pico USB socket; VBUS NOT tied to V5.\nCore J4 pins2 and7 NC. Core power uses separate 5V Berg cable;12V position NC.\nAccessory is custom3V3 SPI only, not UEXT/RS232/5V bus. Active Next adapter pending.\nPin-map study: passive symbols; ERC is not electrical validation. Routing, ESD, host power-off and firmware pending." (at 35 535 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid 7d07100f-fd46-4346-b109-191c85a4b722))(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))